{"unit_id":"cookiesheep__whale-on-desk#card-zh","repo":"cookiesheep/whale-on-desk","commit":"d50a2e45eddcb6cd1483820f9c4c1e8991913581","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"whale-on-desk 是面向 DSH 网页端的像素鲸鱼桌宠，通过监听会话事件并把状态显示在网页浮层中，让 agent 工作时的状态更容易被看见。它会随任务运行、模型思考、工具调用、审批等待和任务完成切换动画；审批时敲击玻璃并闪烁浏览器标题，完成后汇报耗时和工具数量。右键菜单可打开命令面板、水族馆模式、切换自定义宠物，也能查看成长等级。适合希望在网页端获得轻量进度提示和桌面伙伴的 DSH 用户；不需要 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:58-103","lib/index.js:378-505","lib/client.js:178-180","lib/client.js:843-905"]}
{"unit_id":"cookiesheep__whale-on-desk#card-en","repo":"cookiesheep/whale-on-desk","commit":"d50a2e45eddcb6cd1483820f9c4c1e8991913581","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"whale-on-desk is a pixel whale companion for the DSH web UI. It reflects agent activity and tool calls, taps the glass and flashes the tab for approval waits, and reports completed turns. Its menu opens a command palette and aquarium mode and switches custom pets. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:58-103","lib/index.js:378-505","lib/client.js:178-180","lib/client.js:843-905"]}
